<title>JAPAN: Ishii Precision - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Ishii Precision - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		793    million	  vs	  761    million</p>
<p> Operating	 prft 38 million	  vs   loss 126    million</p>
<p> Current	   prft 24 million	  vs   loss 144    million</p>
<p> Net		 prft 51 million	  vs   loss 146    million</p>
<p> EPS	     prft 3.52 yen		vs    loss 10.02 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     15 million		vs	  15 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		    vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Ishii Precision Tool Co Ltd is a maker of super-hard tools, such as turbine cutters.</p>
</text>
